Sugrīva dispatches Aṅgada-led Nīla Hanumān Jāmbavān south with great force --- Seek Vindhya Narmadā serpent Gōdāvarī Kr̥ṣṇavēṇī Varadā Mēkhalā Utkala Daśārṇa Avanti --- Seek Vidarbha R̥ṣika Mahiṣaka Baṅga Kaliṅga Kauśika Daṇḍaka Gōdāvarī Andhra Pāṇḍya Kērala Ayōmukha --- Seek divine Kāvērī apsaras Malaya Agastya crossing Tāmraparṇī sandal isle ocean Pāṇḍya gate --- Reaching ocean deliberate finding Agastya-placed Mahēndra golden ocean-plunged flowering festival hill --- Search hundred-league island specially Sītā slayable Rāvaṇa crossing Aṅgārakā shadow-seizing Puṣpitaka moon-sun peaks --- Bow hill ungrateful blind seek not crossing Sūryavān Vaidyuta honey Kuñjara Agastya house Bhōgavatī Vasuki --- Seek R̥ṣabha sandal touch not guarding Rōhita lords Yama darkness returning month first-seer rewarded
